  "body": "Discover the perfect blend of modern comfort and natural tranquility in this brand-new, single-level home.\r\n\r\nSet along Awa Uru Road, known for its wider street, private feel and nature outlook, this home offers a sense of space and serenity that is truly special. Enjoy a peaceful setting with a calming natural backdrop, while still being part of the growing Strathmill community.\r\n\r\nInside, the home is bright and contemporary, with a thoughtfully designed layout that makes everyday living effortless. Three well-positioned bedrooms provide comfortable accommodation, while excellent indoor-outdoor flow leads to a sunny deck-perfect for relaxing, entertaining or simply enjoying the peaceful surroundings.\r\n\r\nBeyond the comfort of home, you'll discover a lifestyle that truly sets this location apart. With Orewa Beach, local cafes, shops, schools and motorway links all within easy reach, you'll enjoy the perfect balance of coastal living and everyday convenience. For those who enjoy the outdoors, the popular Alice Eaves Scenic Reserve is approximately a 3.5km walk away, offering peaceful walking tracks through native bush, mature kauri trees, scenic lookout points and beautiful natural surroundings.\r\n\r\nKey features include:\r\n\r\n*\t10 Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n*\tThree bedrooms, including a master with ensuite and walk-in wardrobe\r\n*\tMaster bedroom with ranch slider opening directly to the deck\r\n*\tUpmarket open plan kitchen, dining and lounge with great natural light\r\n*\tLarge deck offering easy outdoor living and entertaining\r\n*\tSingle internal-access garage plus one off-street park\r\n*\tLow maintenance 197sqm section, ideal for busy households\r\n\r\nWhether you're a first-home buyer, a growing family or looking to enjoy a modern lifestyle in a tranquil setting, this is an opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\nYour Strathmill Home Tour Awaits!\r\n\r\nDiscover our fantastic selection of brand-new homes throughout Strathmill, with a variety of layouts, sizes and features to suit different lifestyles and budgets.\r\nFrom modern family homes to smart, low-maintenance options, compare your favourites and find the one that feels just right for you.\r\n\r\nCall Shaun Burnett on 021 871 252 or Ann Park on 021 151 8458 today to arrange your personalised Strathmill Home Tour and explore multiple homes in one convenient visit!\r\nYour next home could be waiting for you in Strathmill.\r\n\r\nHow to find Awa Uru Road: * From the motorway, travelling North: Take Exit 394 from SH1, continue on Grand Drive and take the first road on your left onto Flavell Drive. Continue into the Strathmill Development and turn right. At the top, take the first left and continue until you see Awa Uru Road on your right.",
